From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:25:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2413/3799] soh: rename func_809BE26C -> EnBigokuta_Death

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: spins, puffs dust, shrinks away, clears the room and drops a collectible
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c        | 15 ++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c
index a15671139..562edd069 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c
@@ -34,7 +34,8 @@ void func_809BE518(EnBigokuta* this, PlayState* play);
 void EnBigokuta_SpawnWakeSplash(EnBigokuta* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_809BCF68 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809BDFC8: turns onto the recorded opposite heading, flips the circling direction and resumes
 void EnBigokuta_TurnAround(EnBigokuta* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_809BDFC8 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_809BE26C(EnBigokuta* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809BE26C: spins, puffs dust, shrinks away, clears the room and drops a collectible
